          <a href="/en/divorce-in-uae-for-expats/" class="related-card">
            <strong>Divorce in UAE for Expats</strong>
            <span>Non-Muslim civil divorce, timelines, and law choices</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/en/dubai-vs-abu-dhabi-divorce/" class="related-card">
            <strong>Dubai vs Abu Dhabi Divorce</strong>
            <span>Which UAE court framework is right for you</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/en/divorce-lawyer-dubai/" class="related-card">
            <strong>Divorce Lawyer Dubai</strong>
            <span>How to find and choose a family lawyer</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/en/alimony-uae/" class="related-card">
            <strong>Alimony in UAE</strong>
            <span>Maintenance amounts and enforcement</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/en/british-expat-divorce-uae/" class="related-card">
            <strong>British Expat Divorce UAE</strong>
            <span>UAE vs English courts: the financial difference explained</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/en/divorce-certificate-attestation-uae/" class="related-card">
            <strong>UAE Divorce Certificate Attestation</strong>
            <span>How to apostille your UAE decree for use in the UK</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>

    </main>

    <aside class="sidebar">
      <div class="sidebar-sticky">
        <LeadForm />
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .hero-section { background: linear-gradient(rgba(10,22,40,0.74), rgba(10,22,40,0.74)), url('/images/hero-dubai-office.webp') center/cover no-repeat; color: #fff; padding: 3.5rem 1.5rem; }
